title: International Relations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: international_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer += 12;
card-image: img/kcp_international_relations.jpg
max-visits: 4
#subtitle: Building ties with other international subjects can help our cause.

While there is a limit to relation building we can do as a party it is still good to do so.

- @fr_uk: Build a relationship with Amar as they host the Conference.
- @austria: Perhaps we could repair our relationship with Zephyr?
- @scandi: Visit Sentara our long standing allies.
- @comintern: Use Yoakumaen contacts in Zilatra.
- @america: Contact the Yoakumaen diaspora in Rozow.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@fr_uk
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; west_relation += 1; reformist_strength += 5; pacifism += 1; moderate_plan_support += 1

The Amar state is reclusive but Buzzy and the conference offers a way to interact with them and build relations.

@austria
subtitle: -1 resources [? if austrian_parliament_seen and not austrian_civil_war_seen: - We will also help the Austrians oppose their dictatorship. ?]
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
audio: shuffle music/communist/workers_of_vienna_normalized.mp3
on-arrival: left_strength += 5; radicalization += 1; rb_militancy += 0.03; resources -= 1; austria_relation += 1; sdapo_strength += 1 if austrian_parliament_seen = 1

We have for long had bad relations with Zephyr but perhaps that could change , they also provide aid to build up organization of our paramilitary troops.

[? if austrian_parliament_seen and not austrian_civil_war_seen: This also helps bolster the reformist wing of the Zephyrian goverment. ?]


@scandi
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: reformist_strength += 8; wtb_support += 1; resources -= 1; moderate_plan_support += 1

Sentara has a mixed reputation among our populace with some preffering Zephyr in the ongoing cold war. We build relations with Sentara increasing the strength of our Sentaran aligned factions and also perhaps opening some doors in the future on deeper cooperation.


@comintern
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; kpd_relation += 5*(1-dissent); communist_coalition += 1 if comintern_seen == 0; comintern_seen += 1

The Zilatrans are not our natural allies due to our ideaological diffirences but they do posses contacts among leftits and Kaddu and it may be worth building these relations as a way to perhaps influence our own leftists.

@america
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1

The Yoakumaen diaspora in Rozow lacks any real political power or strong connections. Little we can do for them , little they can do for us.

@reduce

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
